<title>HONG KONG: Lippo Land unit sets Asian note programme.</title>
<headline>Lippo Land unit sets Asian note programme.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Lippo Land subsidiary has established a US$300 million guaranteed Asian currency note programme, said arranger Bear Stearns Asia Ltd.</p>
<p>Under the programme, Lippo Land Development International Finance Co BV can issue Asian currency notes that are due from two years to 10 years from the date of original issue.</p>
<p>The notes are guaranteed jointly and severally by PT Lippo Land Development and PT Lippo Cikarang and severally and to a limited extent by PT Lippo Karawaci.</p>
<p>Application has been made to list the notes on the Luxembourg Stock Exchange, but unlisted notes may be issued under the programme.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-6371</p>
</text>
